        "四路低通反馈梳状滤波加左右各两级真正全通滤波，单声道激励、立体声尾音。",
        "Config words: Q26 feedback [0,0.9], damping [0,0.95], wet [0,1], enable [0,1].",
        "Comb lengths 1493,1601,1747,1999. Left allpasses 211,431; right 263,487. Allpass coefficient 0.5.",
